.github.com/repos/LudaLunizz/BananaSplit/zipball/v2.7.1","body":"Windows: a standalone app. One bananasplit.exe, no installer and no console window. BananaSplit lives in the tray: closing the window keeps the mixer running there. The tray menu has Show, Start/Stop recording and Quit. “Start with Windows” starts it quietly in the tray. Settings are saved at logoff, restart and shutdown. The exe now has its app icon and version info. Without the WebView2 Runtime, the mixer opens in your browser and offers Microsoft’s download page.\r\n\r\nLinux: fourteen fixes from a review of 2.7, among them settings saved when the audio server stops, @default following the desktop’s default device, and virtual cables that are never confused with another program’s.\r\n\r\nCI is green on both platforms. The Windows build is checked on a real Windows desktop: 63 launch checks.","mentions_count":1},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LudaLunizz/BananaSplit/releases/422050471","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LudaLunizz/BananaSplit/releases/422050471/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/LudaLunizz/BananaSplit/releases/422050471/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/LudaLunizz/BananaSplit/releases/tag/v2.7.0","id":422050471,"author":{"login":"LudaLunizz","id":33155561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMTU1NTYx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33155561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LudaLunizz","html_url":"https://github.com/LudaLunizz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LudaLunizz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LudaLunizz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LudaLunizz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LudaLunizz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LudaLunizz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LudaLunizz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users